sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Anyone as Public User / Verifier
    participant Browser as Mobile / Desktop Browser
    participant Gateway as Backend API Gateway
    participant Email as Email Service (Resend/Brevo)
    participant DB as MongoDB Atlas
    actor Patient as Patient (Document Owner)

    Note over Anyone,Browser: Verifier scans physical/PDF QR Code (/verify/:token)
    Browser->>Gateway: GET /api/verify/:token
    Gateway->>Gateway: Compute SHA-256(token)
    Gateway->>DB: Query VerificationToken (expires 90d)
    alt Token Invalid or Expired
        DB-->>Gateway: Null record
        Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 404 "TOKEN_NOT_FOUND"
    else Token Valid
        DB-->>Gateway: Token doc (consultationId, patientRef)
        Gateway->>DB: Fetch Consultation (Hospital, Doctor Name, Date)
        DB-->>Gateway: Sanitized consultation issuance details
        Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 200 Public Authenticity Card (ZERO Patient PII)
    end

    opt OTP-Gated Clinical & Medicine Release Unlock
        Browser->>Gateway: POST /api/verify/request-otp { token }
        Gateway->>DB: Fetch Patient masked email & generate 6-digit OTP
        Gateway->>Email: Dispatch OTP verification email
        Email-->>Patient: Delivers 6-digit verification code
        Patient->>Browser: Enters 6-digit OTP code (no NIC entry required)
        Browser->>Gateway: POST /api/verify/unlock { token, otp }
        Gateway->>Gateway: Verify OTP (rate-limited, 5 attempts max)
        alt OTP Invalid or Expired
            Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 400 / 429 "INVALID_OTP"
        else OTP Valid
            Gateway->>DB: Fetch complete consultation details & dispensing records
            Gateway->>Gateway: Compile clinical data + medicine release summary
            Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 200 Unlocked Clinical Encounter & Medicine Release Data
            opt History PDF Download
                Browser->>Gateway: POST /api/verify/:token/history-pdf { token }
                Gateway-->>Browser: HTTP 200 application/pdf (Signed Cumulative History PDF)
            end
        end
    end
